    "detailed_description": "This game is still a work in progress. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931860/extras/ad6cd299fd4786dec74a6a6acfcbc8da.avif?t=1747648949\" data-has-big /></div><br><br><strong>OctaRace</strong> is an explosive racing video game, it pays tribute to the good old multiplayer titles like MicroMachines, offering fun and intense races. <br>Enjoy a family-friendly arcade experience with quick sessions and instant handling. With a &quot;feel-good&quot; spirit and a retro ambiance reminiscent of the PlayStation 1 era, OctaRace provides a colorful and welcoming atmosphere.<br><br>So get those engines started! \ud83d\ude97<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1931860/extras/aa8b4d7284c363bb5d7127a9732bb2c5.avif?t=1747648949\" data-has-big /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Simple controls and deep gameplay<br></li><li> From 1 to 8 players in a same couch or online<br></li><li> A variety of game modes for solo &amp; multiplayer sessions<br></li><li> Choose from a wide selection of iconic vehicles<br></li><li> Customize your choice with fun items and create your own pilot style<br></li><li> Embody diverse &amp; original cast of characters</li></ul>",
